{"kind": "mod", "id": 1250, "name": "Borkel's Bloody Bullet Wounds + Particles + Splatters", "slug": "borkels-bloody-bullet-wounds-particles-splatters", "teaser": "Retextured bullet wounds to feature an actual bullet hole and more blood (vanilla bullet wounds don't even have a hole). Also implemented blood particles with splatters on collisions.", "owner_name": "Borkel", "downloads": 89178, "favourites": 1, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": null, "guid": null, "thumbnail_local": null, "category": null, "category_id": null, "updated_at": "2026-07-07T16:58:54.000000Z", "created_at": "2024-02-20T22:35:32.000000Z", "published_at": "2024-02-20T22:35:32.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~3.10.0", "latest_version": "1.2.4", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": null, "description_html": "<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Quick Preview</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Vanilla bullet wounds are quite disappointing, they don’t even have a bullet hole .</p>\n<p>This mod features more blood and an actual bullet hole, also has blood particles with splatters now. I wouldn’t say it’s as realistic as my other mods, but it’s more realistic than vanilla.</p>\n<p>Bigger bullets will spawn more particles.</p>\n<p>This is how bullet wounds look with my mod:</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EbUxNsd.png\" alt=\"EbUxNsd.png\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VqeQLB8.png\" alt=\"VqeQLB8.png\" /></p>\n<p>With a new particle system that spawns blood splatters on collision:</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ReNJdPv.gif\" alt=\"ReNJdPv.gif\" /><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/UiVbFje.gif\" alt=\"UiVbFje.gif\" /></p>\n<p>The particles and splatters can be configured in the F12 menu. It is highly customizable:</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2v0KYt8.png\" alt=\"2v0KYt8.png\" /></p>\n<p>This is how they look in unmodded vanilla :</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/xVecSAc.png\" alt=\"xVecSAc.png\" /></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Full Preview</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1nLjiSg.png\" alt=\"1nLjiSg.png\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zYMFzoi.png\" alt=\"zYMFzoi.png\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CZRz9Q3.png\" alt=\"CZRz9Q3.png\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/9dX8EER.png\" alt=\"9dX8EER.png\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/XHbhajX.png\" alt=\"XHbhajX.png\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/cfstdM8.png\" alt=\"cfstdM8.png\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tILOFuT.png\" alt=\"tILOFuT.png\" /></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Installation and configuration</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Just drop into the SPTarkov folder.</p>\n<p>Threre’s a F12 config menu:</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2v0KYt8.png\" alt=\"2v0KYt8.png\" /></p>\n<p>I recommend using low values for the splatter chance.</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-4\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Credits</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Thanks to <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/41391-toastynoodle/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">TastyNoodle</a> for creating <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1986-silly-balls/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Silly Balls</a>, which served me to create the particles for this mod.</p>\n<p>Many thanks to pein and Arys for their help with the particle system.</p></div></div></div>\n<p>If you wish to support me and help me achieve my dream of owning night vision goggles you can <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/borkel\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">buy me a coffee</a>.</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/borkel\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://storage.ko-fi.com/cdn/kofi4.png?v=3\" alt=\"kofi4.png?v=3\" /></a></p>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.0.2", "spt_version_constraint": "3.8.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 8851, "published_at": "2024-04-04T16:56:04.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1250/borkels-bloody-bullet-wounds-particles-splatters/1.0.2", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.0.3", "spt_version_constraint": "3.8.1", "content_length": null, "downloads": 8266, "published_at": "2024-05-07T16:50:04.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1250/borkels-bloody-bullet-wounds-particles-splatters/1.0.3", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.1.5", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.9.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 4474, "published_at": "2024-07-21T14:58:45.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1250/borkels-bloody-bullet-wounds-particles-splatters/1.1.5", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.2.4", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.10.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 19946, "published_at": "2025-01-19T